Package: herdr
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: terminal workspace manager for AI coding agents
 herdr is an agent multiplexer that lives in your terminal. It provides a
 terminal workspace manager for running and orchestrating multiple AI coding
 agents side by side, with sessions, workspaces and remotes driven from a
 keyboard-friendly TUI.
